---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Section from '../components/Section.astro';
import Card from '../components/Card.astro';
import Button from '../components/Button.astro';
import Badge from '../components/Badge.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Portfolio | Operations, Salesforce, AI & Web Projects | Mau Consulting"
  description="Real systems running today: custom platforms, executive dashboards, AR automation, AI agents, Salesforce builds, and websites. Each project started with diagnosing the actual problem."
  pageLabel="Portfolio"
>
  <Header />

  <main>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden py-16 sm:py-24 bg-white dark:bg-gray-950">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-accent-50/40 via-transparent to-navy-50/30 dark:from-accent-900/10 dark:via-transparent dark:to-navy-950/20" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
        <Badge variant="accent" class="mb-4">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 inline-block mr-1" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
            <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M6 6V5a3 3 0 013-3h2a3 3 0 013 3v1h2a2 2 0 012 2v3.57A22.952 22.952 0 0110 13a22.95 22.95 0 01-8-1.43V8a2 2 0 012-2h2zm2-1a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v1H8V5zm-2 5a1 1 0 100 2h8a1 1 0 100-2H6z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
          </svg>
          Portfolio
        </Badge>

        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight text-navy-900 dark:text-white mb-6 animate-fade-in-up">
          Real systems.<br />Running today.
        </h1>

        <p class="text-xl sm:text-2xl text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-300 mb-8 animate-delay-100">
          Every project started with diagnosing the actual problem, then building the smallest thing that fixes it. Custom platforms, dashboards, automation pipelines, AI agents, websites &mdash; running in production, not slide decks.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Production Systems I've Built -->
  <Section class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-950" title="Production Systems I&rsquo;ve Built" subtitle="Custom platforms, dashboards, automation pipelines, and AI agents I&rsquo;ve designed and shipped. Most are running today.">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 max-w-6xl">

      <!-- Project Management Platform -->
      <Card class="overflow-hidden h-full flex flex-col">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
          <span class="inline-block px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-navy-100 dark:bg-navy-900/40 text-navy-700 dark:text-navy-300">Custom Platform</span>
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs text-green-600 dark:text-green-400 font-semibold">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-green-500 animate-pulse"></span>
            Live in production
          </span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-navy-900 dark:text-white mb-2">Custom Project Management Platform</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400 mb-4 flex-grow">
          When SaaS PM tools fell short, I built custom. Full-stack platform with AI task assistant, document parsing (PDF/Word/Excel), and multi-view tracking. Replaced Smartsheets and eliminated the need to hire a dedicated project manager.
        </p>
        <div class="border-t border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 pt-3 space-y-1 text-xs">
          <div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">Active Users</span><span class="font-bold text-navy-900 dark:text-white">12 across teams</span></div>
          <div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">Initiatives Tracked</span><span class="font-bold text-navy-900 dark:text-white">5 company-wide</span></div>
          <div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">Stack</span><span class="font-bold text-navy-900 dark:text-white">Next.js, Prisma, AI</span></div>
        </div>
      </Card>

      <!-- Cengage Salesforce Rollout -->
      <Card class="overflow-hidden h-full flex flex-col">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
          <span class="inline-block px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-salesforce-100 dark:bg-salesforce-700/20 text-salesforce-700 dark:text-salesforce-300">Enterprise Rollout</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-navy-900 dark:text-white mb-2">Salesforce Rollout &mdash; Cengage Learning</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400 mb-4 flex-grow">
          Led the company-wide Salesforce implementation across the B2B segment of one of North America&rsquo;s largest education publishers. Built the KPI framework, the compensation model, and replaced a thicket of regional spreadsheets with one source of truth. Onboarding overhaul compressed new-hire ramp from eight months to four weeks.
        </p>
        <div class="border-t border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 pt-3 space-y-1 text-xs">
          <div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">Productivity</span><span class="font-bold text-navy-900 dark:text-white">10&times; in 6 months</span></div>
          <div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">Onboarding Ramp</span><span class="font-bold text-navy-900 dark:text-white">8 months &rarr; 4 weeks</span></div>
          <div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">Scope</span><span class="font-bold text-navy-900 dark:text-white">Multi-region B2B</span></div>
        </div>
      </Card>

      <!-- Executive Dashboard -->
      <Card class="overflow-hidden h-full flex flex-col">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
          <span class="inline-block px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-salesforce-100 dark:bg-salesforce-700/20 text-salesforce-700 dark:text-salesforce-300">Salesforce</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-navy-900 dark:text-white mb-2">Executive Pipeline Dashboard</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400 mb-4 flex-grow">
          Lightning Web Component dashboard with batch Apex snapshots, YoY trending, and quota tracking. Replaced manual Excel reporting with real-time pipeline visibility. Runs weekly without intervention.
        </p>
        <div class="border-t border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 pt-3 space-y-1 text-xs">
          <div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">Snapshot Fields</span><span class="font-bold text-navy-900 dark:text-white">34 tracked weekly</span></div>
          <div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">Test Coverage</span><span class="font-bold text-navy-900 dark:text-white">95%</span></div>
          <div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">Stack</span><span class="font-bold text-navy-900 dark:text-white">LWC, Apex, Chart.js</span></div>
        </div>
      </Card>

      <!-- AR & Collections Automation -->
      <Card class="overflow-hidden h-full flex flex-col">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
          <span class="inline-block px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-navy-100 dark:bg-navy-900/40 text-navy-700 dark:text-navy-300">Python Automation</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-navy-900 dark:text-white mb-2">AR &amp; Collections Automation</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400 mb-4 flex-grow">
          Replaced a manual workbook someone updated by hand. Daily job pulls payment terms from Salesforce, authenticates via Microsoft Graph using a service principal, and drops a clean CSV on SharePoint. No human is the integration anymore.
        </p>
        <div class="border-t border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 pt-3 space-y-1 text-xs">
          <div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">Approach</span><span class="font-bold text-navy-900 dark:text-white">Spreadsheet &rarr; System</span></div>
          <div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">Runs</span><span class="font-bold text-navy-900 dark:text-white">Daily, unattended</span></div>
          <div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">Stack</span><span class="font-bold text-navy-900 dark:text-white">Python, Salesforce, MS Graph</span></div>
        </div>
      </Card>

      <!-- Customer Health Who to Call -->
      <Card class="overflow-hidden h-full flex flex-col">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
          <span class="inline-block px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-navy-100 dark:bg-navy-900/40 text-navy-700 dark:text-navy-300">Reporting</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-navy-900 dark:text-white mb-2">Customer Health &ldquo;Who to Call&rdquo;</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400 mb-4 flex-grow">
          Monthly HTML report flags low-balance customers, sorts by purchase velocity, and gives the sales team a one-click outreach list with prefilled emails. Drives reorder cadence and surfaces churn risk before it materializes.
        </p>
        <div class="border-t border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 pt-3 space-y-1 text-xs">
          <div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">Drives</span><span class="font-bold text-navy-900 dark:text-white">Monthly call cadence</span></div>
          <div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">Lookback</span><span class="font-bold text-navy-900 dark:text-white">3 years of purchases</span></div>
          <div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">Stack</span><span class="font-bold text-navy-900 dark:text-white">Python, Salesforce, HTML</span></div>
        </div>
      </Card>

      <!-- AccountHQ Lost-Deal Analysis -->
      <Card class="overflow-hidden h-full flex flex-col">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
          <span class="inline-block px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-navy-100 dark:bg-navy-900/40 text-navy-700 dark:text-navy-300">Business Intelligence</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-navy-900 dark:text-white mb-2">AccountHQ &mdash; Lost-Deal Analysis</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400 mb-4 flex-grow">
          Analyzed every lost deal across the sales team. Quantified the lost revenue and identified that cost/budget, no-reply, and competing priorities accounted for 63% of losses. Turned &ldquo;we lose deals sometimes&rdquo; into &ldquo;here&rsquo;s the fixable money.&rdquo;
        </p>
        <div class="border-t border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 pt-3 space-y-1 text-xs">
          <div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">Revenue Analyzed</span><span class="font-bold text-navy-900 dark:text-white">$14.2M lost</span></div>
          <div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">Deals Studied</span><span class="font-bold text-navy-900 dark:text-white">1,052</span></div>
          <div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">Stack</span><span class="font-bold text-navy-900 dark:text-white">Python, Salesforce</span></div>
        </div>
      </Card>

      <!-- Credit Dashboard -->
      <Card class="overflow-hidden h-full flex flex-col">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
          <span class="inline-block px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-salesforce-100 dark:bg-salesforce-700/20 text-salesforce-700 dark:text-salesforce-300">Salesforce</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-navy-900 dark:text-white mb-2">Credit Engagement Dashboard</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400 mb-4 flex-grow">
          Sales enablement LWC replacing manual Excel call lists. Engagement scoring (recency, completion, velocity) drives one-click call prioritization for account managers.
        </p>
        <div class="border-t border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 pt-3 space-y-1 text-xs">
          <div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">Replaces</span><span class="font-bold text-navy-900 dark:text-white">5,900-row Excel</span></div>
          <div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">Stack</span><span class="font-bold text-navy-900 dark:text-white">LWC, Python, REST</span></div>
        </div>
      </Card>

      <!-- AI Customer Service Agent -->
      <Card class="overflow-hidden h-full flex flex-col">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
          <span class="inline-block px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-accent-50 dark:bg-accent-900/30 text-accent-700 dark:text-accent-300">AI Agent</span>
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs text-green-600 dark:text-green-400 font-semibold">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-green-500 animate-pulse"></span>
            Live in production
          </span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-navy-900 dark:text-white mb-2">AI Customer Service Agent</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400 mb-4 flex-grow">
          Production AI Agent that classifies, validates, and resolves inbound cases autonomously. Vision-powered receipt processing, structured templates, and confidence-based escalation. The customer-service team scaled from 6 people to 3 while response time improved.
        </p>
        <div class="border-t border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 pt-3 space-y-1 text-xs">
          <div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">Auto-Handle Rate</span><span class="font-bold text-navy-900 dark:text-white">68%</span></div>
          <div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">Volume</span><span class="font-bold text-navy-900 dark:text-white">1,516 cases / 5 weeks</span></div>
          <div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">Operating Cost</span><span class="font-bold text-navy-900 dark:text-white">~$4/month</span></div>
        </div>
      </Card>

      <!-- AI Lead Qualifier -->
      <Card class="overflow-hidden h-full flex flex-col">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
          <span class="inline-block px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-accent-50 dark:bg-accent-900/30 text-accent-700 dark:text-accent-300">AI Agent</span>
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs text-green-600 dark:text-green-400 font-semibold">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-green-500 animate-pulse"></span>
            Live in production
          </span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-navy-900 dark:text-white mb-2">AI Lead Triage &amp; First-Touch</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400 mb-4 flex-grow">
          Azure OpenAI system that classifies every inbound lead, suppresses junk, and sends a personalized first-touch email roughly ten seconds after lead creation. Phased shadow-then-autonomous rollout with confidence scoring and audit trails.
        </p>
        <div class="border-t border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 pt-3 space-y-1 text-xs">
          <div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">Volume</span><span class="font-bold text-navy-900 dark:text-white">365 leads / first 17 days</span></div>
          <div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">Speed</span><span class="font-bold text-navy-900 dark:text-white">~10 sec classification</span></div>
          <div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">Junk Suppressed</span><span class="font-bold text-navy-900 dark:text-white">~11% before any VP sees it</span></div>
        </div>
      </Card>

      <!-- Document Automation -->
      <Card class="overflow-hidden h-full flex flex-col">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
          <span class="inline-block px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-accent-50 dark:bg-accent-900/30 text-accent-700 dark:text-accent-300">AI Vision</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-navy-900 dark:text-white mb-2">Receipt &amp; Document Processing</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400 mb-4 flex-grow">
          GPT-4o vision integration that reads receipts and validates retailer, condition, and pricing automatically. Eliminates manual data entry and reduces fraud risk.
        </p>
        <div class="border-t border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 pt-3 space-y-1 text-xs">
          <div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">Capability</span><span class="font-bold text-navy-900 dark:text-white">Vision + Validation</span></div>
          <div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">Cost</span><span class="font-bold text-navy-900 dark:text-white">~$0.005/receipt</span></div>
        </div>
      </Card>

    </div>
    <div class="text-center mt-8">
      <a href="/#services" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-accent-600 dark:text-accent-400 font-medium hover:underline">
        Want something like this for your business?
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" />
        </svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <!-- Case Studies: Transformation Stories -->
  <Section title="Operations & Systems Work" subtitle="The before and after of real projects">
    <div class="space-y-6 max-w-5xl">

      <!-- Case Study 1: Excel to Dashboards -->
      <div class="bg-white dark:bg-stone-900/60 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 p-8 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-4">
          <Badge variant="accent">Salesforce</Badge>
          <Badge variant="accent">Reporting</Badge>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy-900 dark:text-white mb-2">From 15 Spreadsheets to One Dashboard</h3>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mt-4">
          <div class="bg-stone-50 dark:bg-stone-800/40 rounded-xl p-5">
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-red-500 dark:text-red-400 uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">Before</p>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-stone-400">&bull;</span> Weekly reporting took a full day of manual Excel work</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-stone-400">&bull;</span> 15 spreadsheets across 3 teams, none of them matching</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-stone-400">&bull;</span> Executives making decisions on stale, inconsistent data</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-stone-400">&bull;</span> No one trusted the numbers in meetings</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-accent-50/50 dark:bg-accent-900/10 rounded-xl p-5">
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-green-600 dark:text-green-400 uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">After</p>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-green-600 dark:text-green-400">&#10003;</span> 5 live dashboards pulling from one clean data source</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-green-600 dark:text-green-400">&#10003;</span> Automated delivery to leadership every Monday morning</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-green-600 dark:text-green-400">&#10003;</span> Weekly reporting time dropped from a full day to zero</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-green-600 dark:text-green-400">&#10003;</span> Adopted in every executive meeting within two weeks</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-5">
          <Badge>Salesforce Dashboards</Badge>
          <Badge>Custom Reports</Badge>
          <Badge>Data Cleanup</Badge>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Case Study 2: Scattered Process to Defined Workflow -->
      <div class="bg-white dark:bg-stone-900/60 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 p-8 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-4">
          <Badge variant="accent">Process Design</Badge>
          <Badge variant="accent">Salesforce</Badge>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy-900 dark:text-white mb-2">From 73 Manual Steps to 8 Automated Ones</h3>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mt-4">
          <div class="bg-stone-50 dark:bg-stone-800/40 rounded-xl p-5">
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-red-500 dark:text-red-400 uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">Before</p>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-stone-400">&bull;</span> Leads routed manually by one person checking email</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-stone-400">&bull;</span> 14 handoff points between Marketing and Sales, most undocumented</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-stone-400">&bull;</span> Lifecycle stages meant different things to different teams</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-stone-400">&bull;</span> Forecasting was guesswork</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-accent-50/50 dark:bg-accent-900/10 rounded-xl p-5">
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-green-600 dark:text-green-400 uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">After</p>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-green-600 dark:text-green-400">&#10003;</span> Automated lead routing with clear assignment rules</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-green-600 dark:text-green-400">&#10003;</span> Defined MQL/SQL criteria both teams agreed on</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-green-600 dark:text-green-400">&#10003;</span> Sales velocity improved with shorter time-to-close</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-green-600 dark:text-green-400">&#10003;</span> Documented governance model the team maintains themselves</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-5">
          <Badge>Salesforce</Badge>
          <Badge>Pardot</Badge>
          <Badge>Process Mapping</Badge>
          <Badge>Documentation</Badge>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Case Study 3: Chaos to Tiered Support -->
      <div class="bg-white dark:bg-stone-900/60 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 p-8 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-300">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-4">
          <Badge variant="accent">Operations</Badge>
          <Badge variant="accent">Enablement</Badge>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy-900 dark:text-white mb-2">From "Everything Is Urgent" to a System That Scales</h3>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mt-4">
          <div class="bg-stone-50 dark:bg-stone-800/40 rounded-xl p-5">
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-red-500 dark:text-red-400 uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">Before</p>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-stone-400">&bull;</span> Support team handled every request the same way, no triage</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-stone-400">&bull;</span> High-priority issues delayed by routine questions</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-stone-400">&bull;</span> Same questions asked over and over with no shared answers</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-stone-400">&bull;</span> Leadership had no visibility into volume or resolution time</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-accent-50/50 dark:bg-accent-900/10 rounded-xl p-5">
